.TH FL-FILES 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-files \- file manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-files\fR [\fIFOLDER\fR|\fBtrash:///\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Browse and manage files: icon and list
views, thumbnails, copy/move in the background, the XDG trash, open with, properties and
permissions. Alt+arrows navigate, Ctrl+L edits the location, Ctrl+H toggles hidden files,
F2 renames, Delete moves to the trash, Shift+Delete deletes.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1)
